        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "heading": "Once an industry secret, now available to everyone",
        "text": "<p>Roxanne Rizzo New York was founded in 2009 by celebrity makeup artist Roxanne Rizzo, born from years of working behind the scenes in film and television. As high-definition cameras changed the industry, makeup had to change with it. Every uneven tone, shadow and patch of redness became more visible on camera. <strong>Bronze Glow was created in 2009 and perfected on set under HD cameras and professional film lighting.</strong></p><p>The result was a buildable, universal mist that gives skin an instant, warm, healthy-looking complexion. No color matching or tools needed. What started in Roxanne's own makeup kit became a go-to final step on film and television sets around the world. Now, it's becoming a household name for everyday use.</p>",
